### 1. Change ONLY the special request of r1 (expect 200: no conflict with itself)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "specialRequest": "Birthday celebration - please prepare a cake plate"
}

### 2. Move r1 from 19:00 to 17:00 (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": "17:00"
}

### 3. Table 5 is now free at 19:00 (expect count 7, Table 5 included)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/availability?date=2026-10-10&time=19:00&guests=4

### 4. Move r2 to Table 5 at 17:00 (expect 409: r1 is now there)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "table": "t5",
  "time": "17:00"
}

### 5. r2 becomes 4 guests but keeps 2-seat Table 1 (expect 400: too small)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": 4
}

### 6. r2 becomes 4 guests AND moves to 4-seat Table 7 (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": 4,
  "table": "t7"
}

### 7. Try to change status through edit (expect 400: use /status)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 8. Edit a Completed reservation: r5 (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": 3
}

### 9. Edit a reservation that already started: r6 (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "specialRequest": "Extra rice"
}

### 10. Move r3 to a past date (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-01"
}

### 11. Invalid phone and time (expect 400 with 2 errors)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerPhone": "12345",
  "time": "18:30"
}

### 12. Empty body (expect 400: no changes)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r3
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 13. Reservation that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guests": 2
}

### 14. View r2 after the edit (expect Table 7, 4 guests, updatedAt present)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reservations/r2
